# Preset fields: the Fields section of a tertiary road (Name, ref, lanes, ...),
# a tree (leaf fields with real labels), a cafe and a building.
#
# Viewport (zoom 18, centered on 40.7120, -74.0060): the map center is
# (488, 388). Pass --language de to see the German labels.

window 1200 800
load_osm docs/screenshots/fixtures/preset-fields.osm
viewport 40.7120 -74.0060 18
wait_idle 5s

click 288,238
wait_idle 2s
assert_selection way
capture out/preset-fields-1-road.png

click 488,488
wait_idle 2s
assert_selection node
capture out/preset-fields-2-tree.png

click 638,488
wait_idle 2s
assert_selection node
capture out/preset-fields-3-cafe.png

click 638,188
wait_idle 2s
assert_selection way
capture out/preset-fields-4-building.png
